{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^“Pak, ilmu kanuragan itu apa?” ","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_confused ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Ilmu kanuragan itu merupakan ilmu kekebalan tubuh.” ","#","^speaker:Tour Guide ","/#","#","^portrait:tourguide_more_friendly ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^“Kekebalan tubuh?” ","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_confused ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Iya, kekebalan tubuh. Biasanya itu persiapan sebelum ke medan perang. Jadi, sebelum ke medan perang, prajurit itu bersemedi dahulu di Gua Peteng yang terletak di seberang kita.” ","#","^speaker:Tour Guide ","/#","#","^portrait:tourguide_friendly ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^“Jadi dulu ilmu-ilmu kebal dan sejenisnya itu cukup lumrah digunakan ya Pak?” ","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_oh! ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Betul sekali.” ","#","^speaker:Tour Guide ","/#","#","^portrait:tourguide_default ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}